// shipped is a claim we would have to take back, and half a marketing page is
// worse than none.
//
// THE MARKETING HOME IS NOT LOST. It lives, complete and unrouted, in
// `src/home-body.html` — the "SKIN · GLASS · MIND · WOOD" page from
